{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And Ezra the priest separated men</b> — deficient [in] vav, and the meaning is 'and men.'" "<b>to Darius</b> — a foreign word because of the yod, and it is four letters and of the heavy [pa'el] pattern with dagesh, and it comes with cholam on the pattern of יסור יסרני, קוה קויתי, ויברך ברוך, and the meaning is 'to Darius.'"], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:25.199501114Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}